"""Critic agent variants (legacy architecture).

TODO: Migrate these variants to the new in-container agent loop model.
Currently they use the old /init entrypoint. The new model uses main.py.

Build targets:
    bazel run //props/core/critic/variants:contract_truthfulness_push
    bazel run //props/core/critic/variants:dead_code_push
    bazel run //props/core/critic/variants:flag_propagation_push
    bazel run //props/core/critic/variants:high_recall_push
